8. Request / Data Flows

8.1 Ingestion Flow (Smart Ingestor)

1. User uploads file or text


2. Backend:

Chunks content

Sends chunks to ExtractionService (LLM)

Receives nodes + edges JSON



3. EntityFactory:

Validates entities against templates

Ensures Character entities have valid OCEAN



4. Neo4j:

Writes nodes and relationships

Creates or updates embeddings



5. UI:

Shows ingestion status (via /ws/events)




8.2 AIRPG Session Flow

1. Player opens AIRPG console in UI


2. UI connects to /ws/dm


3. Player sends messages (intent, actions)


4. DM Agent:

Queries Neo4j for relevant entities (QueryAgent)

Reads NPC OCEAN profiles

Generates responses (narrative + dialogue)

Streams output back via WebSocket



5. UI displays narrative, NPC speech, and system prompts



8.3 Contradiction Detection Flow

1. Triggered:

Manually via API

Automatically after ingestion



2. Auditor:

Rule-based checks (timeline, duplication, conflicts)

Semantic checks via LLM



3. Neo4j:

Stores contradiction records



4. UI:

Displays contradiction list for later resolution (MVP can be basic)





