10. Implementation Phases (Code / Dev)

These phases align with your recovery and build-out plan.

Phase 0 — Local Recovery & Hardening

Clean local environment

Single canonical directory:

C:\projects\lore-management-system


Fresh clone from GitHub

One venv, one .env

Fix silent Neo4j errors (no bare except Exception: return [])

Pass import checks

Pass /health locally


Phase 1 — API & Persistence Fixes

Implement /upload/text endpoint matching UI contract

Remove duplicate HTTP helpers in app.py, use api_client.py

Verify runtime-generated NPCs persist correctly to Neo4j

Confirm WebSockets for events are functional


Phase 2 — Smart Ingestor Completion (OCEAN Integration)

Update ExtractionService prompt to require OCEAN in Character nodes

Implement OCEAN validation and defaults in EntityFactory

Integrate EntityFactory into LoreIngestor save pipeline

Verify all new Characters have a valid OCEAN profile


Phase 3 — AIRPG DM Integration

Confirm DM Agent pulls OCEAN data for NPCs

Confirm QueryAgent can query by semantics + OCEAN filters

Implement minimal personality-influenced behavior in DM prompts


Phase 4 — Frontend MVP

Hook up ingestion UI to /upload and /upload/text

Implement simple entity browser

Implement AIRPG console with /ws/dm connection

Basic status indicators for health and Neo4j connection


Phase 5 — Fly.io Deployment

Create Dockerfile

Create fly.toml

Configure Neo4j AuraDB env vars

Deploy single app to Fly

Bind UI to hosted API URL

Smoke test: ingestion, entity browser, DM console



