11. Operational Notes

Error Handling

No silent failures on DB or LLM calls

Log tracebacks with clear messages

Fail fast in critical paths


Logging

Minimal but structured logging for:

Ingestion events

DM session starts/ends

Neo4j connection issues

Auditor runs



Health Checks

/health should verify:

App is running

Neo4j reachable

Vector index exists or is created

DM/Auditor initialized



Security (MVP)

No public link distribution

Use ADMIN_API_KEY for admin-only operations

Keep .env outside repo; use Fly secrets for production




